    FAx : Ov (ext ST Y2) (ext SQ Y1) XQ su XS' PAx fx (IN.fst (ext ST Y2) XS' FmS' prX) =
      IN.fst-ov (ext ST Y2) (ext SQ Y1) XQ FmQ su XS' PAx FmS' PBf PWs phS prX PwS ;

    PWX2 : Id (Ty (ext ST Y2)) (subT (ext ST Y2) (ext SQ Y1) (wkT SQ Y1 X1) su) (wkT ST Y2 X2) = wkT-ov ST SQ Y1 X1 sg Y2 PY2 X2 PX2 ;
