    hx : IN.TE (ext ST Y2) (subT (ext ST Y2) (ext SQ Y1) (wkT SQ Y1 X1) su) (wkT ST Y2 X2) (subt (ext ST Y2) (ext SQ Y1) (wkT SQ Y1 X1) fx1 su) xS =
      IN.teT (ext ST Y2) (subT (ext ST Y2) (ext SQ Y1) (wkT SQ Y1 X1) su) (subT (ext ST Y2) (ext SQ Y1) XQ su) (wkT ST Y2 X2)
