           (EQ.wkF SQ Y1 X1 Y1 uQ) (EQ.wkF ST Y2 X2 Y2 uS) (EQ.wkF-ov ST SQ Y1 X1 Y1 sg Y2 PY2 X2 Y2 PFuX uQ uS Pu PFw)
           (app (ext SQ Y1) (wkT SQ Y1 Y1) (wkT SQ Y1 X1) (EQ.wkF SQ Y1 Y1 X1 vF) (q SQ Y1)) xS
           (app-ov (ext ST Y2) (ext SQ Y1) (wkT SQ Y1 Y1) (wkT SQ Y1 X1) su (wkT ST Y2 Y2) PWY2 (wkT ST Y2 X2) PWX2 PFv
