    PPiId : Id (Ty ST) (subT ST SQ (PS.Pi SQ Y1 IdQ) sg) (PS.Pi ST Y2 IdS) = Pi-ov ST SQ Y1 IdQ sg Y2 PY2 IdS PIdS ;

    LH : Ov ST SQ (PS.Pi SQ Y1 IdQ) sg (PS.Pi ST Y2 IdS) PPiId (lam SQ Y1 IdQ hb) (lam ST Y2 IdS hS) =
